  1	//! Durable, session-scoped snapshot/tail projection for first-party surfaces.
  2	//!
  3	//! Session JSON remains canonical provider history. This journal records the
  4	//! ordered UI frames after the last matching persistence checkpoint plus folded
  5	//! ephemeral state. Its broadcast carries wake hints only; SQLite is authority.
